     "id": "813830d",
     "elType": "widget",
     "widgetType": "text-editor",
     "settings": {
      "editor": "<p>Stories are short, plain pieces about starting therapy in the UK: what a first session is actually like, how much it costs and how to ask, whether online works, and how to tell if it is doing anything. Each one opens with a direct answer you can take away on its own. None of them is a testimonial, and none is a substitute for talking to a professional.</p>",
      "_css_classes": "gt-answer"
     },
     "elements": []
    }
   ],
   "isInner": false
  },
