    {
     "id": "3182e4e",
     "elType": "widget",
     "widgetType": "html",
     "settings": {
      "html": "<ul class=\"article-list\">\n<li class=\"article-list__item\">\n<p class=\"meta\">Starting · 6 min read</p>\n<div><h2 class=\"h3\"><a href=\"/stories/what-happens-in-a-first-therapy-session/\" style=\"color:inherit;text-decoration:none\">What happens in a first therapy session?</a></h2><p class=\"soft\" style=\"margin:.5rem 0 0;max-width:60ch\">What the first hour is actually for, what a therapist is likely to ask, and why you do not have to decide anything in the room.</p></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"article-list__item\">\n<p class=\"meta\">Money · 6 min read</p>\n<div><h2 class=\"h3\"><a href=\"/stories/how-much-does-therapy-cost-in-the-uk/\" style=\"color:inherit;text-decoration:none\">How much does therapy cost in the UK?</a></h2><p class=\"soft\" style=\"margin:.5rem 0 0;max-width:60ch\">How private fees are set, what affects them, what is free on the NHS, and how to ask about cost without embarrassment.</p></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"article-list__item\">\n<p class=\"meta\">Online · 5 min read</p>\n<div><h2 class=\"h3\"><a href=\"/stories/can-i-have-therapy-online/\" style=\"color:inherit;text-decoration:none\">Can I have therapy online?</a></h2><p class=\"soft\" style=\"margin:.5rem 0 0;max-width:60ch\">Who online counselling suits, what changes when the room is a screen, and how to set it up so it works.</p></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"article-list__item\">\n<p class=\"meta\">Keeping going · 6 min read</p>\n<div><h2 class=\"h3\"><a href=\"/stories/how-do-i-know-if-therapy-is-working/\" style=\"color:inherit;text-decoration:none\">How do I know if therapy is working?</a></h2><p class=\"soft\" style=\"margin:.5rem 0 0;max-width:60ch\">It rarely feels like progress from the inside. What to look for, what to say to your therapist, and when to stop.</p></div>\n</li>\n</ul>"
     },
